        female_name="female^diversion"
        description="If there is an enemy of the target on the opposite side of the target, this unit diverts the target’s attention and reduces its chance to hit by 20%."
        special_note="If there is an enemy of the target on the opposite side of the target while attacking it, this unit diverts the target’s attention and reduces its chance to hit."
